msgstr "`pip install \"gwexpy[analysis,fitting,plotting]\"`"

#: ../../tutorials/installation.md:18 e5b6f956a49e440ba84687e7fe7061bb
msgid "Advanced statistics, curve fitting, and mapping features."
msgstr "高度な統計解析、最小二乗法、地図描画など。"

#: ../../tutorials/installation.md:18 6beadf4d38a941aeb8d6e26ff72837f6
